WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.859 --> 00:00:05.190
Released just in time for Comic-Con, here's
everything you might have missed in the first

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:09.860
trailer for Kevin Smith's long-awaited Jay
and Silent Bob Reboot.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.200
As a wise man once said:

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.909
"um… snootchie bootchies?"

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:22.900
The title of Jay and Silent Bob Reboot tells
audiences exactly what it is a super meta

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:27.500
reboot of Smith's 2001 film Jay and Silent
Bob Strike Back.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.649
In the original Jay and Silent Bob Strike
Back, our dim-witted stoner protagonists traveled

00:00:32.649 --> 00:00:37.050
to Hollywood to shut down a movie version
of Bluntman and Chronic, a comic book that

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:41.230
imagines Jay and Silent Bob as marijuana-themed
superheroes.

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.870
That film was lampooning Hollywood adaptations.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:48.890
Jay and Silent Bob Reboot is, you guessed
it, lampooning Hollywood reboots by using

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:53.800
the exact same plot: the studio is now rebooting
the Bluntman and Chronic film, so Jay and

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:57.300
Silent Bob have to once again go to Hollywood
to stop it.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.520
Expect a lot of fourth-wall breaking inside
jokes.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.720
"What do you guys think about this reboot?"

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:03.730
"It sucks!

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.730
There, I said it.

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:06.560
And who's directing it?

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.480
Kevin f------ Smith?!"

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:13.680
Jay and Silent Bob Reboot looks to be a franchise-capping
movie, pulling characters from two decades'

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:16.220
worth of interconnected Kevin Smith movies.

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:21.710
Rosario Dawson appears in the trailer, likely
reprising her role as Becky from Clerks II.

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:26.150
Matt Damon found one of his earliest roles
in Smith's Dogma, and in Jay and Silent Bob

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:30.900
Reboot, he returns as Loki, the avenging angel
he played in the latter.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:34.990
Damon's buddy Ben Affleck is also a Smith
veteran, and he appears in the trailer as

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:40.430
Holden McNeil, the comic book artist who created
Bluntman and Chronic in Chasing Amy.

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:45.159
Also on hand at that convention: Jason Biggs
and James Van Der Beek, the original Bluntman

00:01:45.159 --> 00:01:49.650
and Chronic from the movie-inside-of-a-movie
in Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back.

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:54.600
And in this film as in the last Jay and Silent
Bob movie, the heroes find out about the movie

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:58.800
version from comics lover Brodie Bruce, still
portrayed by Jason Lee.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:03.360
It's not just old friends making cameos, there
are plenty of new faces too.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:09.009
In a cheeky bit of self-referential humor,
former Batman Val Kilmer plays himself, playing

00:02:09.009 --> 00:02:12.940
Bluntman, with Supergirl's Melissa Benoist
acting as Chronic.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:17.890
In other cameos from new cast members, Donnell
Rawlings from Chappelle's Show heads up a

00:02:17.890 --> 00:02:24.680
SWAT team, Craig Robinson plays a judge, Joe
Manganiello is a bailiff, Justin Long plays

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:29.300
a lawyer, and Fred Armisen shows up as an
unlucky Uber-type driver.

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:33.510
Even some other famous screen stoners make
an appearance: rappers Method Man and Redman,

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.560
as well as the legendary Tommy Chong.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:38.360
And there are also some new characters as
well.

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:42.920
Shannon Elizabeth reprises her role from Jay
and Silent Bob Strike Back as an old love

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:47.989
interest of Jay's, but this time she has a
surprise: two daughters, one of which is Jay's

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:52.200
love child played by Kevin Smith's actual
daughter, Harley Quinn Smith.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:56.840
Everyone knows Smith is a huge comic book
fan, so it's no surprise that there are a

00:02:56.840 --> 00:03:02.040
ton of nods to the Marvel Cinematic Universe
in the Jay and Silent Bob Reboot trailer.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:06.410
Chris Hemsworth, famous for playing Thor in
the MCU, shows up briefly.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:10.519
Kevin Smith, as Silent Bob, gets involved
in some kind of action sequence that finds

00:03:10.519 --> 00:03:14.190
him inside of a high-tech suit clearly inspired
by Iron Man.

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:18.519
David Dastmalchian, who portrayed Russian
hacker Kurt in the Ant-Man movies, makes an

00:03:18.519 --> 00:03:20.621
appearance as a high-strung SWAT team member.

00:03:20.621 --> 00:03:26.430
And just like in an actual Marvel movie, there's
even a Stan Lee appearance of sorts Jason

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:30.519
Lee can be seen wearing a T-shirt bearing
the face of the dearly departed Marvel master

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:31.720
and cameo king.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:36.680
Finally, the first and coolest cameo in the
Jay and Silent Bob reboot trailer isn't even

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:40.310
by a person it's by a run down old building.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:44.970
Yes, fans of Kevin Smith's Askewniverse may
recognize the building as the location of

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:48.720
Smith's first film, the beloved cult classic
Clerks.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:52.520
We can't wait to see what other easter eggs
await when the film hits theaters on October

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:53.520
15th.

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:54.520
See you there!

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.850
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:59.930
Plus, even more Looper videos about your favorite
stuff are coming soon.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.810
